Summary

We are looking for an experienced HubSpot Automation Developer who can demonstrate strong, hands
on experience working directly inside HubSpot.
This is not simply an n8n integration project. The right person should be comfortable building,

troubleshooting, testing, and maintaining HubSpot native workflows, while also integrating HubSpot with
n8n and external systems when appropriate

A key requirement for this project is the ability to ensure that communications and automated activities are
correctly associated with the appropriate HubSpot records.

What We Need

We currently use HubSpot together with n8n for CRM automation and communication workflows.
Some emails and notifications triggered through n8n are not consistently visible within the corresponding
HubSpot contact records. Our team needs to open a contact profile and see the relevant communication
history without checking multiple systems.

We need someone who can investigate this type of issue and determine whether the problem involves:

• Email delivery or sending
• HubSpot activity logging
• Contact identification or matching
• Incorrect record associations
• API implementation
• Workflow enrollment or execution
• n8n workflow logic

You should also be able to determine when an automation should be handled through a native HubSpot
workflow and when n8n is the better solution.

HubSpot Responsibilities

You should have direct experience working inside HubSpot with:
• Native HubSpot workflows and automation
• Workflow enrollment criteria and re-enrollment
• Contact and company properties
• Deal pipelines and stages
• Contact, company, deal, and activity associations






• Email and communication activity
• Lists and segmentation
• Reporting and dashboards
• Workflow troubleshooting and execution history
• HubSpot APIs, webhooks, and authentication
• Safe testing before production deployment

You should understand how to modify existing HubSpot environments without accidentally disrupting
active workflows or historical CRM data.

n8n Integration

You should also be comfortable building and troubleshooting integrations between HubSpot and n8n

HubSpot triggers/webhooks → n8n → business logic/API calls → HubSpot updates
Experience with JavaScript, JSON, REST APIs, webhooks, authentication, retries, error handling, and
duplicate prevention is important.
We want workflows designed so that retries or failures do not accidentally generate duplicate emails,
activities, contacts, or CRM updates.

AI Automation

Experience implementing AI in real business workflows is strongly preferred.
Examples could include:
• Email classification
• Lead qualification
• CRM data extraction
• Communication summarization
• Automated follow-up preparation
• Document processing
• Internal workflow assistance

You should be able to explain how you validate AI output before allowing it to affect CRM records or
business processes.


